6. + lib/Platform/: Taken from Platform/OS, which FileUtils/where requires.
7. + Gemfile: gem 'nokogiri'
8. + lib_dir, which is put on the load path.
9. + require_nokogiri(): Install nokogiri where it can't be required.
10. /require 'nokogiri'/require_nokogiri/


